        {
          "key": "section.product.tarot.json.main.acc_gift.text:3ngow1cezxfso",
          "sk": "<p>Darček pre niekoho blízkeho: pre partnera, pre kamarátku, pre mamu.</p><p>Pôvodné ilustrácie, prvé vydanie, 100 kusov v každom jazyku — a niečo, čo ešte takmer určite nedostal. Vyberte vydanie v jazyku, v ktorom číta. Chcete mu balíček poslať rovno? V pokladni zadajte jeho adresu ako adresu doručenia.</p>",
          "outdated": false,
          "en": "<p>A present for someone close: your partner, a friend, your mum.</p><p>Original illustrations, a first edition of 100 copies per language, and something they’ve almost certainly never been given before. Pick the edition in the language they read. Want it sent straight to them? Put their address in as the delivery address at checkout.</p>",
          "digest": "1d07b664ee6ac1a0e68acbd77fa2714232dc4333f7c87dbc48453c1b6a9ca471"
